+                    <h3>If a prompt would do the job, do not build a GPT</h3>
+                    <p>The workbench opens with this as its stated core principle. A Custom GPT that cannot outperform a well-written one-off prompt does not deserve to exist, and the Build Brief is designed to surface that verdict early rather than after the build.</p>
